    <item>
      <title>Use AI for Technical Writing Without Losing Your Voice</title>
      <link>https://abhirockzz.github.io/blog/use-ai-for-tech-writing/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://abhirockzz.github.io/blog/use-ai-for-tech-writing/</guid>
      <description>
        
        
        &lt;p&gt;Should you use AI for technical writing? After experimenting with everything from simple editing prompts to multi-agent drafting and verification workflows, I have strong opinions about where AI helps and where it gets in the way. In this video, I share what worked, what did not, and why I now use AI for the heavy lifting without outsourcing my perspective, judgment, or voice.&lt;/p&gt;
